{"ticker":{"symbol":"353200.KS","name":"대덕전자","market":"KR","exchange":""},"currency":"KRW","price":93400.0,"change_pct":0.02524698133918779,"market_cap":4811262525440.0,"pe":13.867804,"pb":null,"dividend_yield":0.0053533190578158455,"week52_low":0.0,"week52_high":198000.0,"sector":"Technology","industry":"Electronic Components","country":"South Korea","city":"Ansan-Si","employees":2085,"website":"https://www.daeduck.com","business_summary":"DAEDUCK ELECTRONICS Co., Ltd. provides various printed circuit boards (PCB) in South Korea and internationally. It offers flip chip ball grid array; flip chip scale package; chip scale package; system in package; antenna in package; and flip chip board on chip. The company also provides wired network PCBs, which is used to connect devices, such as laptop and desktop to the Internet, and other networks using cable; and optical modules, a PCB that is used in the plug-in transceiver designed for broadband data communication. The company was founded in 1972 and is headquartered in Ansan-Si, South Korea.","business_summary_ko":"대덕전자(주)는 국내외 다양한 인쇄회로기판(PCB)을 공급하고 있습니다. 플립 칩 볼 그리드 어레이를 제공합니다. 플립 칩 스케일 패키지; 칩 스케일 패키지; 패키지 내 시스템; 패키지의 안테나; 칩 보드를 칩 위에 뒤집어 놓습니다. 이 회사는 또한 노트북, 데스크탑 등의 장치를 인터넷에 연결하고 케이블을 사용하여 기타 네트워크에 연결하는 데 사용되는 유선 네트워크 PCB를 제공합니다. 광대역 데이터 통신을 위해 설계된 플러그인 트랜시버에 사용되는 PCB인 광 모듈. 이 회사는 1972년에 설립되었으며 본사는 대한민국 안산시에 위치하고 있습니다.","desc_ko":"","estimates":[{"period":"2026","rev":1591067400000.0,"rev_lo":1582600000000.0,"rev_hi":1599300000000.0,"rev_g":0.4935,"n":12,"eps":4532.6704,"eps_lo":4056.0,"eps_hi":4968.0,"eps_g":3.9055},{"period":"2027","rev":2016859680000.0,"rev_lo":1767300000000.0,"rev_hi":2168600000000.0,"rev_g":0.2676,"n":13,"eps":6735.025,"eps_lo":4881.0,"eps_hi":7949.325,"eps_g":0.4859}],"ltg":null,"calendar":{},"industry_ko":"전자부품","financials":[{"period":"2022","revenue":1316163420250.0,"operating_income":232523019500.0,"net_income":183925142570.0,"eps":3570.0},{"period":"2023","revenue":909651486890.0,"operating_inc